{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/708bc3ea02915686d376a2eac646cfc3.avif?t=1755881784\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Based on a true story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A darkness creeps into the life of a grieving man, twisting his reality.</strong> In <i><strong>FORCE RESTART</strong></i>, a first-person psychological survival horror thriller, explore surreal worlds with mind-bending traversal and haunting storytelling to uncover the secrets of the void \u2014 or be lost to it forever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.poster.avif?t=1755881784\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.webm?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.mp4?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fb622ab2529732ff08410af421059f1d.avif?t=1755881784\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Perspective - </strong>Immerse yourself, up close and personal in a suspenseful, dark tale, packed with twists and turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/2a2ebcb9dac602dfed0bcc77272ee38c.poster.avif?t=1755881784\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/2a2ebcb9dac602dfed0bcc77272ee38c.webm?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/2a2ebcb9dac602dfed0bcc77272ee38c.mp4?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat - </strong>Collect what you can &amp; use it wisely. Scavenge for supplies, conserve ammo and plan your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/6264ca2d766fc8f817b036d7103af724.poster.avif?t=1755881784\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/6264ca2d766fc8f817b036d7103af724.webm?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/6264ca2d766fc8f817b036d7103af724.mp4?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling &amp; Puzzles</strong> - Every piece tells a story. Uncover the haunting tale through solving puzzles, uncovering memories, cryptic encounters, and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/ab798d6c1b4df55f953573030eb9b89b.poster.avif?t=1755881784\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/ab798d6c1b4df55f953573030eb9b89b.webm?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/ab798d6c1b4df55f953573030eb9b89b.mp4?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments &amp; Sound Design</strong> - Leveraging the power of Unreal Engine 5, experience high-quality visuals and atmospheric audio soundscapes that bring  shifting worlds to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/c30b0353d03c96c0cfd65c32b1a4420f.poster.avif?t=1755881784\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/c30b0353d03c96c0cfd65c32b1a4420f.webm?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/c30b0353d03c96c0cfd65c32b1a4420f.mp4?t=1755881784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827730?t=1755881784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/44a64da13b6ef907f7ca5fcf6469a7576222f9b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755881784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/507ab93e07be4889ed10edbc4f904328c385bfc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755881784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/507ab93e07be4889ed10edbc4f904328c385bfc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755881784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Fami